<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20416> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has abridger collective agent"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20416> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/regap/lexicalAlias> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/abridgerCollectiveAgent.en> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20416> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates an expression to a collective agent who contributes to an expression by shortening an expression of a related work without changing the general meaning or manner of presentation."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20416> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "abridger collective agent"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20416> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "A collective agent who contributes to an expression by shortening an expression of a related work without changing the general meaning or manner of presentation."@en .
