<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20029> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20029> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/regap/status> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/RegStatus/1001> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20029> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates an expression to an agent who contributes to an expression of a work by rewriting a composition for a medium of performance different from that for which a work was originally intended."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20029> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20029> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Contribution includes modification of a work for the same medium of performance, etc., that keeps the musical substance of the original composition essentially unchanged, and excludes substantial modification that results in the creation of a new musical work."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20029> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/c/C10006> .
