<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20038> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates an expression to an agent who contributes to an expression by overseeing artists and craftspeople who build sets for moving image productions."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20038> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
