<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20285> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has choral conductor agent"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20285> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/regap/lexicalAlias> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/choralConductorAgent.en> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20285> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates an expression to an agent who contributes to an expression by leading a choral performing group in a musical or dramatic presentation."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20285> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/c/C10006> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20285> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "choral conductor agent"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20285> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "An agent who contributes to an expression by leading a choral performing group in a musical or dramatic presentation."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20285> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "agente conductor coral"@es .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20285> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "Un agente que contribuye a una expresión dirigiendo un grupo coral en una presentación musical o dramática."@es .
