<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20011> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "An agent who is a performer who contributes to an expression of a musical work by leading a performing group in a musical or dramatic presentation."@en .
