<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20053> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "Agent qui est responsable de la réalisation d’une œuvre."@fr .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20053> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "agente creador de expresión."@es .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20053> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "Un agente que es responsable de la realización de una obra."@es .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20053> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "A creator of expression includes a translator, arranger of music, performer, etc. A creator of a work that is realized by an expression is also a creator of expression."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20053> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "har bidragsgivare"@sv .
