<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20033> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates an expression to an agent who contributes to an expression by an architect, inventor, or other agent by making detailed plans or drawings for buildings, ships, aircraft, machines, objects, or other constructions."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20033> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
