<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20207> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has illustrative content (Deprecated)"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20207> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "har illustrativt innehåll"@sv .
