<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20047> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has interviewee agent of expression"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20047> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates an expression to an agent who contributes to an expression by responding to an interviewer, usually a reporter, pollster, or some other agent who gathers information."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20047> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
