<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20531> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates an expression to a family who contributes to an expression by responding to an interviewer, usually a reporter, pollster, or some other agent who gathers information."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20531> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "interviewee family of expression"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20531> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "A family who contributes to an expression by responding to an interviewer, usually a reporter, pollster, or some other agent who gathers information."@en .
