<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20326> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "A set of pitch relationships that establishes the tonal centre, or principal tonal centre, used, or intended to be used, for performance of musical content of an expression."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20326> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates an expression to a set of pitch relationships that establishes the tonal centre, or principal tonal centre, used, or intended to be used, for performance of musical content of an expression."@en .
