<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20228> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates an expression to a ratio of the dimensions of an expression of an image or three-dimensional form to the dimensions of the thing that is represented."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20228> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
