<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20293> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20293> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has mixing engineer agent"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20293> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/regap/lexicalAlias> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/mixingEngineerAgent.en> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20293> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates an expression to an agent who is an audio engineer who contributes to the audio content of an expression by manipulating, mixing, and assembling the multiple tracks of a recording."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20293> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Remixing activities that substantially change the nature and content of the original work, resulting in a new work, are excluded."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20293> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/c/C10006> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20293> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "mixing engineer agent"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20293> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "An agent who is an audio engineer who contributes to the audio content of an expression by manipulating, mixing, and assembling the multiple tracks of a recording."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20293> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20292> .
