<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20444> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates an expression to a collective agent who is an audio engineer who contributes to the audio content of an expression by manipulating, mixing, and assembling the multiple tracks of a recording."@en .
