<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20373> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates an expression to a person who is a performer who contributes to an expression by leading a program, often broadcast, where topics are discussed, usually with participation of experts in fields related to the discussion."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20373> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "moderator person"@en .
