<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20294> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20294> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has music programmer agent"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20294> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/regap/lexicalAlias> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/musicProgrammerAgent.en> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20294> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "The creation of a new musical work is excluded."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20294> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/c/C10006> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20294> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "music programmer agent"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20294> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "An agent who contributes to an expression of a musical work by using electronic audio devices or computer software to generate sounds."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20294> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20329> .
