<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20421> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates an expression to a collective agent who contributes to an expression of a musical work by using electronic audio devices or computer software to generate sounds."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20421> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "music programmer collective agent"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20421> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "A collective agent who contributes to an expression of a musical work by using electronic audio devices or computer software to generate sounds."@en .
