<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20480> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20480> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/regap/status> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/RegStatus/1001> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20480> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has music programmer corporate body"@en .
