<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20013> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has onscreen presenter agent"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20013> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates an expression to an agent who is a performer who contributes to an expression by appearing on screen to provide contextual or background information."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20013> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20013> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Appearance in nonfiction moving image materials or in introductions to fiction moving image materials is included. Appearance on screen in a non-performing role is excluded."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20013> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/c/C10006> .
