<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20493> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates an expression to a corporate body who is a performer who contributes to an expression by participating in a program, often broadcast, where topics are discussed, usually with participation of experts in fields related to the discussion."@en .
