<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20410> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates an expression to a collective agent who contributes to an expression by performing music, acting, dancing, speaking, and other roles, often in a musical or dramatic presentation."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20410> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "performer collective agent"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20410> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "A collective agent who contributes to an expression by performing music, acting, dancing, speaking, and other roles, often in a musical or dramatic presentation."@en .
