<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20469> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has performer corporate body"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20469> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/regap/lexicalAlias> <http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/performerCorporateBody.en> .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20469> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates an expression to a corporate body who contributes to an expression by performing music, acting, dancing, speaking, and other roles, often in a musical or dramatic presentation."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20469> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitLabel> "performer corporate body"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20469> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "A corporate body who contributes to an expression by performing music, acting, dancing, speaking, and other roles, often in a musical or dramatic presentation."@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20469> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
