<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20528> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates an expression to a family who contributes to an expression by performing music, acting, dancing, speaking, and other roles, often in a musical or dramatic presentation."@en .
