<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20528> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "A family who contributes to an expression by performing music, acting, dancing, speaking, and other roles, often in a musical or dramatic presentation."@en .
