<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20565> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates an expression to a family who is included in statement of an \"X presents:\" credit in a manifestation that embodies an expression and who is probably associated with production, finance, or distribution of an expression of a moving image work in some way."@en .
