<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20565> <http://metadataregistry.org/uri/profile/rdakit/toolkitDefinition> "A family who is included in statement of an \"X presents:\" credit in a manifestation that embodies an expression and who is probably associated with production, finance, or distribution of an expression of a moving image work in some way."@en .
