<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20492> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates an expression to a corporate body who is a performer who contributes to an expression by manipulating, controlling, or directing puppets or marionettes in a moving image production or a musical or dramatic presentation or entertainment."@en .
