<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20384> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates an expression to a person who is an actor who contributes to an expression by providing the voice for characters in radio and audio productions and for animated characters in moving image works, as well as by providing voice-overs in radio and television commercials, dubbed expressions, etc."@en .
