<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20026> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates an expression to an agent who contributes to an expression by adding music to a work that originally lacked it, by composing new music to substitute for original music, or by composing new music to supplement existing music. (Deprecated)"@en .
<http://rdaregistry.info/Elements/e/P20026> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
